5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I wish to ensure our reporting remains transparent. I will look into the appraisal needs at the last audit and independent checks on holdings' reported figures.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I am concerned about the actual durability of our returns. I'll examine the profile of the exits and the write-off and account retention through price rises.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,We must be mindful of our long-term liquidity. I will review the reserve accounts and follow-on calls and the terms of last winter's credit line.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to see if we can actually support these teams with people! I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I suspect hidden bottlenecks in deployment. I will investigate the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
