25,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It appears that hardware and depots complicate our audits significantly, though they do provide verifiable data that software simply cannot offer.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Our successful exits were in back-office financial tools. Interestingly, some of our software tools have struggled to keep customers during price hikes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Minako,,"We are seeing follow-on capital called much faster than planned, and our credit line is quite restrictive regarding subscription-based security.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mio,,"We can fill support roles quickly, but finding operational supervisors or field crews is taking far too long.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Security reviews for medical or financial data are causing massive delays, whereas simple software deployments are moving much faster.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, if financial tools are our win-condition, we should look for that pattern in the candidates.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, I agree. However, we must ensure the customer retention is stable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, if field crews are hard to find, we should be wary of any company requiring heavy physical operations.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Minako, exactly! I don't want us spending all our time hunting for supervisors.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Servas, the audit burden you mentioned likely correlates with the physical assets I saw in the delivery records.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, that is a keen observation. The lack of independent verification for software is a trade-off for easier audits.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, does the credit line issue make us lean away from subscription models?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, it means we cannot rely on them for borrowing. We need a lean approach to follow-on calls.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, are the security delays only for specific industries?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, yes. Medical and financial records are the primary culprits for the three-quarter delays.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
